---A blocking question or confirmation the assistant needs answered before an agent action can proceed. The requesting agent is paused and resumes only when the answer arrives on a later StreamChatAiAssistantRequest.confirmation_response.
---@class gcp.ces_v1.AssistantConfirmationRequest
---@field targets? gcp.ces_v1.AssistantConfirmationRequestTargetList Everything the confirmed action will change, so the console can render "Update 2 apps" and one badge per app. Empty for legacy single-target cards.
---@field negativeLabel? string Label for the declining action of a binary confirmation (e.g. "Not yet"). Unset when `questions` is populated.
---@field agentName? string Display label of the agent that raised the confirmation (e.g. `"Contract Architect"`), for the card header.
---@field positiveLabel? string Label for the approving action of a binary confirmation (e.g. "Publish"). Unset when `questions` is populated.
---@field questions? gcp.ces_v1.OptionQuestionsChunkQuestionList Multi-choice form of the confirmation. When populated, the card renders a selectable option list and the chosen option's submit_text (or free-form user text) is returned as AssistantConfirmationResponse.answer_text.
---@field tool? string Name of the tool call the agent paused on (e.g. "update_app"), for the card header. Unset for pure questions.
---@field context? string Context describing what is being confirmed (e.g. the action the agent wants to take, or the question it needs answered). Rendered as plain text, not Markdown.
---@field confirmationId? string Identifier correlating this request with its response. Opaque to clients; must be echoed verbatim on the answering request.
---@field expireTime? string Time after which this confirmation can no longer be answered. An expired card renders as inactive, and the server declines the confirmation on the next turn so the paused agent does not wait indefinitely.

---One resource the confirmed action will change.
---@class gcp.ces_v1.AssistantConfirmationRequestTarget
---@field resource? string The resource that will change, as a full resource name.
---@field action? string The action, e.g. `CREATE`, `UPDATE`, `DELETE`, `COPY`, `LINK`.
---@field displayName? string Display name of the resource or app, for the card.
---@field targetApp? string The app the resource belongs to, or empty for a location-scoped action such as creating an app. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/apps/{app}`

---@alias gcp.ces_v1.AssistantConfirmationRequestTargetList gcp.ces_v1.AssistantConfirmationRequestTarget[]

---The user's answer to an AssistantConfirmationRequest, sent on the next SessionService.StreamChatAiAssistant call to resume the paused agent.
---@class gcp.ces_v1.AssistantConfirmationResponse
---@field confirmed? boolean Binary answer: true approves the paused action, false declines it.
---@field answerText? string The chosen option's submit_text, or free-form user text. The paused action is cancelled and the text is handed to the agent to act on.
---@field confirmationId? string The AssistantConfirmationRequest.confirmation_id being answered.

