---@field name? string Required. A human-readable name for the skill.
---@field securityRequirements? gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1SecurityRequirementList Security schemes necessary for this skill.
---@field tags? gcp.ces_v1.StringList Required. A set of keywords describing the skill's capabilities.
---@field description? string Required. A detailed description of the skill.
---@field examples? gcp.ces_v1.StringList Example prompts or scenarios that this skill can handle.
---@field outputModes? gcp.ces_v1.StringList The set of supported output media types for this skill, overriding the agent's defaults.

---@alias gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1AgentSkillList gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1AgentSkill[]

---Artifacts represent task outputs.
---@class gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1Artifact
---@field parts? gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1PartList Required. The content of the artifact. Must contain at least one part.
---@field metadata? gcp.ces_v1.DocumentMap Optional. Metadata included with the artifact.
---@field description? string Optional. A human readable description of the artifact.
---@field extensions? gcp.ces_v1.StringList The URIs of extensions that are present or contributed to this Artifact.
---@field name? string A human readable name for the artifact.
---@field artifactId? string Required. Unique identifier (e.g. UUID) for the artifact. It must be unique within a task.

---@alias gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1ArtifactList gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1Artifact[]

---Defines authentication details, used for push notifications.
