---@field scheme? string Required. HTTP Authentication Scheme from the [IANA registry](https://www.iana.org/assignments/http-authschemes/). Examples: `Bearer`, `Basic`, `Digest`. Scheme names are case-insensitive per [RFC 9110 Section 11.1](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110#section-11.1).

