---@field tokenUrl? string Required. The token URL to be used for this flow.
---@field pkceRequired? boolean Indicates if PKCE (RFC 7636) is required for this flow. PKCE should always be used for public clients and is recommended for all clients.
---@field authorizationUrl? string Required. The authorization URL to be used for this flow.
---@field scopes? gcp.ces_v1.StringMap Required. The available scopes for the OAuth2 security scheme.
---@field refreshUrl? string The URL to be used for obtaining refresh tokens.

---Defines configuration details for the OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials flow.
