---@field openIdConnectUrl? string Required. The [OpenID Connect Discovery URL](https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-discovery-1_0.html) for the OIDC provider's metadata.

---`Part` represents a container for a section of communication content. Parts can be purely textual, some sort of file (image, video, etc) or a structured data blob (i.e. JSON).
---@class gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1Part
---@field raw? string The `raw` byte content of a file. In JSON serialization, this is encoded as a base64 string.
---@field text? string The string content of the `text` part.
---@field filename? string An optional `filename` for the file (e.g., "document.pdf").
---@field data? any Arbitrary structured `data` as a JSON value (object, array, string, number, boolean, or null).
---@field url? string A `url` pointing to the file's content.
---@field mediaType? string The `media_type` (MIME type) of the part content (e.g., "text/plain", "application/json", "image/png"). This field is available for all part types.
---@field metadata? gcp.ces_v1.DocumentMap Optional. metadata associated with this part.

---@alias gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1PartList gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1Part[]

---Deprecated: Use Authorization Code + PKCE or Device Code.
---@class gcp.ces_v1.LfA2aV1PasswordOAuthFlow
