---@field customHeaders? gcp.ces_v1.StringMap Optional. The custom headers to send in the request to the MCP server. The values must be in the format `$context.variables.` and can be set in the session variables. See https://docs.cloud.google.com/customer-engagement-ai/conversational-agents/ps/tool/open-api#openapi-injection for more details.
