---@field contractFinalized? boolean Set on the final artifact event of a turn whose contract draft was published (a revision was activated). Terminal for the clarification flow of this draft: contract_progress is authoritative and complete.
---@field contractStreamingPhase? gcp.ces_v1.TurnMetadataContractStreamingPhaseEnum Set only on in-flight progress estimates emitted while a contract artifact fence is streaming, and on the revision-turn-start event. Unset on authoritative payloads.

---@alias gcp.ces_v1.TurnMetadataContractStreamingPhaseEnum "CONTRACT_STREAMING_PHASE_UNSPECIFIED"|"DRAFTING"|"REVISING"

---A compacted replay of an in-flight turn: everything needed to render the turn's visible output so far, plus the position live events continue from.
